WEBVTT

1
00:01:18.750 --> 00:01:20.416
In these four verses,

2
00:01:20.416 --> 00:01:21.416
Lord Krishna

3
00:01:21.416 --> 00:01:23.833
describes the different paths

4
00:01:23.833 --> 00:01:27.208
through which the soul travels

5
00:01:27.208 --> 00:01:30.041
to its next destination after leaving the body.

6
00:01:30.041 --> 00:01:30.958
In the previous verses,

7
00:01:30.958 --> 00:01:32.750
He explained

8
00:01:32.750 --> 00:01:35.541
how a devotee attains liberation.

9
00:01:35.541 --> 00:01:39.041
Now He sheds light on other paths.

10
00:01:39.041 --> 00:01:41.458
This section describes the future

11
00:01:41.458 --> 00:01:42.958
of jnana-yogis, karma-yogis,

12
00:01:42.958 --> 00:01:45.541
and ashtanga-yogis.

13
00:01:45.541 --> 00:01:46.708
It shows

14
00:01:46.708 --> 00:01:48.875
how careful planning of one’s departure

15
00:01:48.875 --> 00:01:50.458
can influence

16
00:01:50.458 --> 00:01:52.791
whether the soul

17
00:01:52.791 --> 00:01:56.541
returns to the material world

18
00:01:56.541 --> 00:01:59.833
or attains a higher spiritual state.

19
00:02:04.791 --> 00:02:06.750
In verse 8.23, Lord Krishna

20
00:02:06.750 --> 00:02:10.666
introduces the concept

21
00:02:10.666 --> 00:02:13.541
of different times of death,

22
00:02:13.541 --> 00:02:15.541
which determine whether a yogi

23
00:02:15.541 --> 00:02:20.833
returns to the material world or not.

24
00:02:20.833 --> 00:02:21.583
This begins the detailed explanation

25
00:02:21.583 --> 00:02:22.708
of the verses

26
00:02:22.708 --> 00:02:25.916
that follow.

27
00:02:25.916 --> 00:02:29.250
He addresses those on different
 paths like jnana-yoga, 

28
00:02:29.250 --> 00:02:30.416
karma-yoga,

29
00:02:30.416 --> 00:02:33.500
and ashtanga-yoga –

30
00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:34.708
explaining how,

31
00:02:34.708 --> 00:02:37.500
through specific practices

32
00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:38.666
and a well-timed departure,

33
00:02:38.666 --> 00:02:41.500
they attempt to control their exit

34
00:02:41.500 --> 00:02:44.958
from the material realm.

35
00:02:44.958 --> 00:02:48.000
Verse 8.24 describes the path

36
00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:51.083
of the jnana-yogi,

37
00:02:51.083 --> 00:02:53.500
who departs during auspicious times –

38
00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:57.083
under fire, in daylight,

39
00:02:57.083 --> 00:02:58.583
during the bright fortnight,

40
00:02:58.583 --> 00:03:00.125
or during the six months

41
00:03:00.125 --> 00:03:02.375
when the sun moves northward,

42
00:03:02.375 --> 00:03:04.833
known as Uttarayana –

43
00:03:04.833 --> 00:03:08.541
and strives toward liberation.

44
00:03:08.541 --> 00:03:10.375
According to Vedic tradition,

45
00:03:10.375 --> 00:03:14.958
this path is guided by a series of devas,

46
00:03:14.958 --> 00:03:16.625
who lead the soul through

47
00:03:16.625 --> 00:03:17.916
various regions

48
00:03:17.916 --> 00:03:19.833
of the universe

49
00:03:19.833 --> 00:03:21.750
until it reaches Brahman.

50
00:03:21.750 --> 00:03:24.541
This process is described in the Upanishads.

51
00:03:24.541 --> 00:03:26.916
Which explains how the soul travels 

52
00:03:26.916 --> 00:03:29.083
through different cosmic realms

53
00:03:29.083 --> 00:03:32.875
under the guidance of these deities.

54
00:03:32.875 --> 00:03:35.625
Verse 8.25 describes the path

55
00:03:35.625 --> 00:03:36.833
for karma-yogis –

56
00:03:36.833 --> 00:03:41.666
those engaged in fruitful activities.

57
00:03:41.666 --> 00:03:42.625
If they leave the body at night,

58
00:03:42.625 --> 00:03:43.708
during the dark fortnight,

59
00:03:43.708 --> 00:03:45.916
or when the sun

60
00:03:45.916 --> 00:03:47.583
moves southward,

61
00:03:47.583 --> 00:03:50.333
they reach the lunar realm.

62
00:03:50.333 --> 00:03:53.125
There, they enjoy the fruits

63
00:03:53.125 --> 00:03:55.166
of their virtuous actions for a long time

64
00:03:55.166 --> 00:03:57.500
and then return to the earthly realm.

65
00:03:57.500 --> 00:03:59.125
This journey is overseen

66
00:03:59.125 --> 00:04:02.458
by a different set of devas

67
00:04:02.458 --> 00:04:04.166
and ultimately leads back

68
00:04:04.166 --> 00:04:07.916
to the cycle of birth and death.

69
00:04:07.916 --> 00:04:12.083
In verse 8.26, 

70
00:04:12.083 --> 00:04:13.416
Lord Krishna summarises

71
00:04:13.416 --> 00:04:16.375
these two paths –

72
00:04:16.375 --> 00:04:20.000
the path of light, leading to liberation,

73
00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:23.625
and the path of darkness, leading to return.

74
00:04:23.625 --> 00:04:26.291
These paths have existed 
since time immemorial,

75
00:04:26.291 --> 00:04:27.416
because the cycle

76
00:04:27.416 --> 00:04:31.791
of birth and death in the
 material world has no beginning.

77
00:04:31.791 --> 00:04:34.541
The path of light leads to liberation,

78
00:04:34.541 --> 00:04:37.208
while the path of darkness

79
00:04:37.208 --> 00:04:40.375
brings one back to repeated birth.

80
00:04:40.375 --> 00:04:44.750
Lord Krishna’s discussion here highlights

81
00:04:44.750 --> 00:04:46.791
jnana-yogis and karma-yogis need

82
00:04:46.791 --> 00:04:48.958
to depart at the right time

83
00:04:48.958 --> 00:04:51.833
to reach their desired destination

84
00:04:51.833 --> 00:04:54.750
how many precautions are necessary.

85
00:04:54.750 --> 00:04:57.166
For devotees engaged in pure devotion,

86
00:04:57.166 --> 00:04:59.541
however, these complex details are irrelevant.

87
00:04:59.541 --> 00:05:00.500
Their path is beyond

88
00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:03.500
the influence of these material factors –

89
00:05:03.500 --> 00:05:05.000
governed only by their devotion

90
00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:08.000
to Lord Krishna.

91
00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:09.083
This sets the stage for Lord Krishna

92
00:05:09.083 --> 00:05:11.250
to emphasise the simplicity

93
00:05:11.250 --> 00:05:13.583
and supremacy

94
00:05:13.583 --> 00:05:15.666
of bhakti-yoga.

95
00:05:20.333 --> 00:05:22.708
When you set out on a journey,

96
00:05:22.708 --> 00:05:26.708
do you think about

97
00:05:26.708 --> 00:05:29.791
how you will prepare and plan?

98
00:05:29.791 --> 00:05:31.291
One who understands

99
00:05:31.291 --> 00:05:34.875
the purpose of the journey

100
00:05:34.875 --> 00:05:38.291
plans accordingly.

101
00:05:38.291 --> 00:05:42.291
There are two ways to live in this world –

102
00:05:42.291 --> 00:05:48.666
just as there are two paths for leaving it.

103
00:05:48.666 --> 00:05:50.208
One path

104
00:05:50.208 --> 00:05:53.333
is centred on personal pleasure –

105
00:05:53.333 --> 00:05:55.250
chasing happiness, wealth,

106
00:05:55.250 --> 00:05:58.708
and momentary enjoyment.

107
00:05:58.708 --> 00:06:03.750
The other is centred on spiritual growth –

108
00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:08.666
developing your consciousness
 and deepening your connection with Me.

109
00:06:08.666 --> 00:06:12.291
If you live only for material gain,

110
00:06:12.291 --> 00:06:16.250
always chasing temporary pleasures,

111
00:06:16.250 --> 00:06:18.875
then when death comes,

112
00:06:18.875 --> 00:06:21.208
your mind will be full of attachments

113
00:06:21.208 --> 00:06:24.541
and desires.

114
00:06:24.541 --> 00:06:26.500
This will pull you back

115
00:06:26.500 --> 00:06:31.250
into the cycle of birth and death.

116
00:06:31.250 --> 00:06:32.791
On the other hand,

117
00:06:32.791 --> 00:06:33.458
if you live

118
00:06:33.458 --> 00:06:37.333
with the goal of spiritual growth –

119
00:06:37.333 --> 00:06:40.125
using every moment

120
00:06:40.125 --> 00:06:43.833
to deepen your bond with Me –

121
00:06:43.833 --> 00:06:47.041
you will leave this world in peace

122
00:06:47.041 --> 00:06:51.208
and move toward My eternal abode.

123
00:06:51.208 --> 00:06:54.750
How you live today

124
00:06:54.750 --> 00:06:56.916
will determine

125
00:06:56.916 --> 00:07:00.125
what tomorrow holds.

126
00:07:00.125 --> 00:07:02.375
Choose a path

127
00:07:02.375 --> 00:07:05.750
that elevates your consciousness

128
00:07:05.750 --> 00:07:09.958
and brings you closer to Me –

129
00:07:09.958 --> 00:07:13.708
for this is the true preparation

130
00:07:13.708 --> 00:07:18.208
for your final journey.

131
00:07:18.208 --> 00:07:20.791
With the light of knowledge,

132
00:07:20.791 --> 00:07:24.416
you will move toward that divine joy

133
00:07:24.416 --> 00:07:29.041
that is always waiting for you.

134
00:07:33.916 --> 00:07:36.500
In family life,

135
00:07:36.500 --> 00:07:39.250
living righteously –

136
00:07:39.250 --> 00:07:41.708
acting in accordance

137
00:07:41.708 --> 00:07:44.916
with truth and justice –

138
00:07:44.916 --> 00:07:47.208
automatically prepares you

139
00:07:47.208 --> 00:07:50.666
to leave this world in a devoted,

140
00:07:50.666 --> 00:07:54.208
peaceful way.

141
00:07:54.208 --> 00:07:57.291
When you make decisions guided
 by values, compassion,

142
00:07:57.291 --> 00:07:59.541
and your own spiritual growth,

143
00:07:59.541 --> 00:08:03.250
making decisions with focused attention

144
00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:09.166
you are not only creating 
a peaceful family environment –

145
00:08:09.166 --> 00:08:11.750
you are also laying the foundation

146
00:08:11.750 --> 00:08:14.458
for a gentle departure

147
00:08:14.458 --> 00:08:18.750
when the time comes.

148
00:08:18.750 --> 00:08:21.000
Different people may choose

149
00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:24.000
to live in different ways.

150
00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:27.458
But remember –

151
00:08:27.458 --> 00:08:31.208
every choice has consequences.

152
00:08:31.208 --> 00:08:36.416
A life spent only chasing worldly gain

153
00:08:36.416 --> 00:08:39.958
can lead to attachments

154
00:08:39.958 --> 00:08:45.583
that hold you back at the time of leaving.

155
00:08:45.583 --> 00:08:48.625
On the other hand,

156
00:08:48.625 --> 00:08:51.458
a life lived with devotion and righteousness

157
00:08:51.458 --> 00:08:54.958
allows you to depart with peace

158
00:08:54.958 --> 00:08:57.208
and clarity.

159
00:08:57.208 --> 00:08:59.875
As a family,

160
00:08:59.875 --> 00:09:03.750
always choose wisely –

161
00:09:03.750 --> 00:09:07.083
reflect on what truly matters –

162
00:09:07.083 --> 00:09:10.000
and encourage one another

163
00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:14.708
to live with a higher purpose.

164
00:09:14.708 --> 00:09:17.875
By choosing to live righteously,

165
00:09:17.875 --> 00:09:20.666
you are not only improving your present life,

166
00:09:20.666 --> 00:09:24.416
but also preparing yourself

167
00:09:24.416 --> 00:09:29.166
and your entire family

168
00:09:29.166 --> 00:09:32.125
for a dignified farewell from this world

169
00:09:32.125 --> 00:09:35.458
when that time comes.

170
00:09:35.458 --> 00:09:40.583
When you choose the path
 of love and service within your family, 

171
00:09:40.583 --> 00:09:42.541
you all move together

172
00:09:42.541 --> 00:09:44.458
on the divine path

173
00:09:44.458 --> 00:09:48.750
toward My eternal abode.

174
00:09:53.708 --> 00:09:57.666
As you sow, so shall you reap.

175
00:09:57.666 --> 00:09:59.458
At the workplace,

176
00:09:59.458 --> 00:10:03.208
you can work in two ways –

177
00:10:03.208 --> 00:10:05.375
with a selfish mindset

178
00:10:05.375 --> 00:10:08.666
or with a spirit of service.

179
00:10:08.666 --> 00:10:12.291
Just as I describe

180
00:10:12.291 --> 00:10:15.500
two paths at the time of death –

181
00:10:15.500 --> 00:10:18.333
one leading to liberation

182
00:10:18.333 --> 00:10:21.500
and one leading back –

183
00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:25.125
your approach at work follows a similar pattern.

184
00:10:25.125 --> 00:10:26.875
When you work with selfish intentions –

185
00:10:26.875 --> 00:10:29.875
focused only on personal gain, recognition,

186
00:10:29.875 --> 00:10:33.875
or quick success –

187
00:10:33.875 --> 00:10:36.958
you may see immediate results.

188
00:10:36.958 --> 00:10:38.750
But

189
00:10:38.750 --> 00:10:41.208
this path often leads to strained

190
00:10:41.208 --> 00:10:45.250
relationships, a lack of trust,

191
00:10:45.250 --> 00:10:49.625
and long-term dissatisfaction.

192
00:10:49.625 --> 00:10:51.500
Think of someone

193
00:10:51.500 --> 00:10:52.625
who holds back

194
00:10:52.625 --> 00:10:56.500
their colleagues’ success

195
00:10:56.500 --> 00:10:59.041
just to shine alone.

196
00:10:59.041 --> 00:11:01.500
They may receive short-term praise,

197
00:11:01.500 --> 00:11:03.583
but over time,

198
00:11:03.583 --> 00:11:08.416
they lose the support of those around them –

199
00:11:08.416 --> 00:11:10.833
and end up isolated.

200
00:11:10.833 --> 00:11:12.583
On the other hand,

201
00:11:12.583 --> 00:11:16.083
when you adopt a spirit of service –

202
00:11:16.083 --> 00:11:20.000
thinking about how you can contribute

203
00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:23.250
 to your team and organisation –

204
00:11:23.250 --> 00:11:24.833
you align yourself

205
00:11:24.833 --> 00:11:28.375
with a higher purpose.

206
00:11:28.375 --> 00:11:32.041
So make your actions service-driven,

207
00:11:32.041 --> 00:11:35.250
not self-driven.

208
00:11:35.250 --> 00:11:38.750
You will certainly find lasting success –

209
00:11:38.750 --> 00:11:42.666
one that is in harmony with your deeper values.

210
00:11:42.666 --> 00:11:48.625
When you serve others through your work,

211
00:11:48.625 --> 00:11:52.666
you walk that divine path

212
00:11:52.666 --> 00:11:57.000
where excellence and fulfilment truly reside.
